<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Nu-World details capitalisation award.</title>
<headline>Nu-World details capitalisation award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics and electrical group Nu-World Holdings Ltd said on Monday shareholders would be offered capitalisation shares in the ratio 0.7 for every 100 held in lieu of the cash dividend of 10.6 cents.</p>
<p>Register date is November 1 and pay date December 11.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
